11
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:49,575
Bella@Such a coincidence, then why have I never met you here?

12
00:00:50,225 --> 00:00:53,250
You@Well, maybe I happened to be sleeping

13
00:00:53,775 --> 00:00:56,950
Bella@Oh, are you that exaggerated?

